---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 mt-20 pt-16 pb-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
      <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
        <a class="flex items-center gap-2 group mb-6" href="/">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">
            V
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">ValueLoop</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-sm mb-6">
          SaaS platform untuk menghidupkan core value perusahaan melalui tantangan harian, leaderboard, dan insight.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 text-slate-400">
          <a href="#" class="hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">
            <span class="sr-only">Twitter</span>
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8.29 20.251c7.547 0 11.675-6.253 11.675-11.675 0-.178 0-.355-.012-.53A8.348 8.348 0 0022 5.92a8.19 8.19 0 01-2.357.646 4.118 4.118 0 001.804-2.27 8.224 8.224 0 01-2.605.996 4.107 4.107 0 00-6.993 3.743 11.65 11.65 0 01-8.457-4.287 4.106 4.106 0 001.27 5.477A4.072 4.072 0 012.8 9.713v.052a4.105 4.105 0 003.292 4.022 4.095 4.095 0 01-1.853.07 4.108 4.108 0 003.834 2.85A8.233 8.233 0 012 18.407a11.616 11.616 0 006.29 1.84" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">
            <span class="sr-only">LinkedIn</span>
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Produk</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li><a href="/#features" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Fitur</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#how-it-works" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Cara Kerja</a></li>
          <li><a href="/login" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Masuk</a></li>
          <li><a href="/signup" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Daftar</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Sumber Daya</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li><a href="/blog" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Blog & Artikel</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Panduan Budaya Kerja</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Studi Kasus</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Bantuan</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
        &copy; {currentYear} ValueLoop. Hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-6 text-sm">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Kebijakan Privasi</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Syarat & Ketentuan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
